{title: I feel like praising, praising Him}

{comment: Chorus}
I feel like praising, praising Him
I feel like praising, praising Him
Praise Him in the morning, praise Him all night long.
I feel like praising, praising Him
Alternates:
If you don’t want to praise Him, don’t hinder me.
